  "dct_description_sm": [
    "To better understand radiative forcing in the Beaufort Sea region a dataset that describes cloud cover conditions is highly valuable. We had the opportunity to deploy an all-sky camera, which would take imagery that could be post-processed to provide a cloud fraction time series dataset. A set of manual meteorological observations is also included to complement the dataset."
